Apartment with with new and unique interior
This modern, light filled one bedroom apartment is stylishly furnished with a luxurious feel and includes ultra-modern fittings and fixtures.

The property comprises of a large living/dining area with floor-to-ceiling windows and great views;

Modern open-plan kitchen with polished marble counter-tops and stainless steel appliances;

The kitchen, dining and living areas combine to offer a seamless living space.

One bedroom,one bath with fitted wardrobes, oversized windows and contemporary high efficiency lighting;

The master bedroom also includes an en-suite bathroom;

The apartment is close to restaurants, cafes and major shopping malls, so if you're are looking for the executive lifestyle, this property offers it all.

Rent is inclusive of EWA bills, Tax for cprinternet and satellite.

